## Quick Visual Overview

| Column | Color | Default Tasks |
|--------|-------|--------------|
| **Pending** | 🟡 Yellow | New tasks land here |
| **In Progress** | 🔵 Blue | Click pending → moves here |
| **Completed** | 🟢 Green | Click in_progress → finishes here |

The app is fully self-contained — just open `index.html` and start managing your tasks!

