## Quick Start Summary

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Save all four files in the same folder |
| 2 | Open `index.html` in your browser |
| 3 | Add tasks, click to cycle status, filter, and delete as needed |
| 4 | Reload the page — your tasks will still be there |

The app is fully self-contained with **zero dependencies**. Everything runs client-side using vanilla JS, CSS Grid for the three-column board layout, and localStorage for persistence.

